(7550029, 1209271, 30049, '<td valign="top">Higher vote on this one from me.  Some interest in the street view and the POV this shot was taken from.  The colors work well and that sky was playing nice for you at the time too!  :-)</td>', 'Higher vote on this one from me.  Some interest in the street view and the POV this shot was taken from.  The colors work well and that sky was playing nice for you at the time too!  :-)', '2017-12-27 22:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
